{"id":"renseignement","lemma":"renseignement","pos":"noun","rank":2226,"glosses":["piece of information","intelligence (gathering of information about hostile forces; agencies that do so)"],"ipa":"/ʁɑ̃.sɛɲ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/Fr-renseignement.ogg/Fr-renseignement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"renseignements"},"formAudio":{"renseignements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-renseignements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'avais besoin de renseignements.","en":"I needed information.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103039","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"On a reçu un renseignement anonyme.","en":"We received an anonymous tip.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"anonymous"}]},{"text":"Êtes-vous certains que ces renseignements sont fiables ?","en":"Are you sure this information is reliable?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"reliable, dependable","l":"fiable"}]},{"text":"Elle me donna des conseils ainsi que des renseignements.","en":"She gave me advice as well as information.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"piece of advice","l":"conseil"},null,null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"as, just as, like"]]},{"text":"J'ai besoin de renseignements sur ce qui s'est passé.","en":"I need information about what happened.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"past"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"thereupon"]]}]}